      ],
      "text": "The CLI exposes commands grouped as create/run (create, claude), access (url, screen, code, shell, open, logs, dashboard), inspect (list, status, top), lifecycle (start, stop, destroy, pause/unpause), sync (download, cp, checkpoint), and advanced (wait, prune, self-update, config, relay, app)."
