        "slc_be2112026b4060bb27f11b606ab5b70dcb79663ec84a80d362ad28c8f82259a2"
      ],
      "text": "`agentbox claude` creates a sandboxed box and launches Claude Code in a detachable tmux session, and `agentbox attach 1` reconnects to a box later."
    },
