      ],
      "text": "Requirements are macOS (arm64 or Intel) or Linux, Docker Desktop or OrbStack, and Node >=20.10; the first create/claude builds a ~1 GB agentbox/box:dev image once, and portless gives box web apps consistent URLs."
    },
