      "text": "Cloud provider credentials are configured via per-provider interactive login commands (vercel, hetzner, daytona, e2b, digitalocean) saved to ~/.agentbox/secrets.env, and remote-docker connects over SSH using the user's own ~/.ssh/config."
    },
